  "body": "A must view. Highly Motivated Vendor\r\n\r\nStep into the lifestyle you deserve with this large, top-floor apartment perfectly positioned in one of Takapuna’s most desirable complexes. If you’ve been searching for comfort, convenience, and a little touch of luxury, your new home awaits.\r\n\r\nWhat You’ll Love:\r\n- Three generously sized bedrooms – ideal for families or those who need a home office\r\n- Two modern bathrooms – making busy mornings a breeze\r\n- Two secure car parks – plus TWO storage lockers for all your extras\r\n- Resort-style amenities – unwind in the exceptional pool complex or stroll through beautifully landscaped gardens\r\n- Central Takapuna location – enjoy cafes, shops, beaches, and transport right at your doorstep\r\n\r\nOur vendor is ready for her next adventure and has her bags packed – meaning this opportunity is ready for you, right now. Properties in this sought-after complex are rarely available, and this spacious top-floor apartment is truly something special.\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange a viewing and see for yourself why this could be the perfect next chapter for you.",
